    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2919060/extras/c96cdd808644d0ba9f3516413d6fc1e2.avif?t=1713817023\" width=600 height=338 /></span><br>Take on the role of a safebreaker who must break as many codes as possible to safes located in a closed bank. There is not much time left, because it is already starting to dawn and the bank employees will soon appear. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2919060/extras/719b8b5522da22abf8587a7d52a2489e.avif?t=1713817023\" width=600 height=338 /></span><br>Using your skills and hearing, you must decipher as many access codes to bank safes as possible and finally get to the large vault, where the main prize awaits - real gold and a huge amount of cash. Can you do it? Find out by entering the race against time.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2919060/extras/daf2565127379d02b92ce6c0f09c4faa.avif?t=1713817023\" width=600 height=338 /></span>",
